# Kea DHCPv6 per Portitor instance (portitor-kea6@.service). The AppArmor
# profile for kea-dhcp6 on Debian/Ubuntu only allows Kea's own file names;
# install.py adds these rules to the profile's local include
# (/etc/apparmor.d/local/usr.sbin.kea-dhcp6). The paths are the defaults of
# etc_dir, kea_data_dir and kea_socket_dir in /etc/portitor/agent.yaml, and
# the unit's KEA_PIDFILE_DIR and KEA_LOCKFILE_DIR.
/etc/portitor/instances/*/kea-dhcp6.conf r,
/etc/portitor/instances/*/kea-dhcp6.dnsmgr2.json r,
/var/lib/kea/kea-leases6-*.csv* rwk,
/run/kea/kea6-*.sock rw,
/run/kea/kea6-*.sock.lock rwk,
/run/kea/*/ r,
/run/kea/*/kea-dhcp6.kea-dhcp6.pid rwk,
/run/kea/*/logger_lockfile rwk,
